-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">W<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">o<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;Outward wind force, psf (kN\/m\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t) due to basic design wind speed, <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">V<\/span>, as calculated in Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-177562', hash: '#JD_BC1609' }}\">1609<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182727\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182727\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">D<\/span>&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;The dead weight of the glazing, psf (kN\/m\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t) as determined in Section 2404.2 for glass, or by the weight of the plastic, psf (kN\/m\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">2<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t) for plastic glazing.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-182728\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-182728\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&